		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I am saddened to hear this.  I knew Sarmad when he had his restaurant in San Antonio.  He was a remarkable man and I&#8217;ve often wondered where he was.  I&#8217;ve have had conversations with him in my mind and wanted very much to connect with him.  </p>
<p>Rest in peace.</p>
<p>Doug Anderson</p>
